.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]The **Snobbish Upperclassman** is the school's
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]academic darling, the kendo team's star athlete,
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]and easily the most popular girl on campus -- and
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]she knows it. You'd be lucky if she gave you the
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]time of day...or honored you by allowing you to tell
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]it to her.
